@baseUrl = https://localhost:7184

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Public configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/config

### Official AI usage
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/ai/usage

### Returns 503 until an official provider is configured
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/ai/meal-analysis
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "manual-test-001",
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "description": "米饭150克，番茄炒蛋一份"
}

### Invalid request returns 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/ai/meal-analysis
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "manual-test-002",
  "locale": "zh-CN"
}
